iochi a calcio. Tuttavia, Finn decide ugualmente di prendere lezioni di violino da Luuk ma, quando scoprirà le ragioni dell'avversità del padre alla musica, si ritroverà di fronte a un grande dilemma.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2013-12-11","status":"Released","rating":6.4,"ratingCount":19,"genres":["Famiglia"],"countries":["Netherlands"],"facts":{"Runtime":"90m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1265165,"name":"Mels van der Hoeven","role":"Finn","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ZDeyuVE8udkjglXpYRjj6zx9IN.jpg"},{"id":82456,"name":"Daan Schuurmans","role":"Finn's vader","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jmmL0S475lwnes1OXiYLSPK8jme.jpg"},{"id":1249070,"name":"Jenny Arean","role":"Mevrouw Eissing","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tAq6s4OfIr0l1sfAPmlKe9VzoVT.jpg"},{"id":69497,"name":"Hanna Verboom","role":"Juf Leonore (Finn's lerares)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3jjGaPdhtLJEGOGQVpHRApvIi8p.jpg"},{"id":13514,"name":"Jan Decleir","role":"Luuk","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wgCWRtfO4HROS1o2QltEGh9DLGG.jpg"},{"id":2051210,"name":"Justin Emanuels","role":"Erik","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oaJtHlJ03AYNYBo6FBJ4tOzCzec.jpg"},{"id":1165551,"name":"Manou Kersting","role":"Rinus Dozeman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ztSLISolyNss8zlSUfbhu5olGj.jpg"},{"id":1564218,"name":"Esther Scheldwacht","role":"Inty - Erik's moeder","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eiGaPCgVkZvL7sFg1K0vK8fsx0j.jpg"},{"id":1243532,"name":"Mark van Eeuwen","role":"Rogier - Erik's vader","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8rvmR9ge6nPhqGcdVONfCsn3LgU.jpg"},{"id":1395735,"name":"Freerk Bos","role":"Dominee"},{"id":1742955,"name":"Annelies Appelhof","role":"Finn's moeder","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2bRqVO7x9TqjAvUpvKfbTJD7YnD.jpg"},{"id":1071502,"name":"Nellie Benner","role":"Secretaresse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m2ChFx1KY3A1NMTJCovQggbLBWl.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Finn - Musica per un sogno","overview":"Finn ha 9 anni e vive con il padre in un piccolo villaggio olandese. Un giorno uno sconosciuto di nome Luuk si trasferisce in una vecchia casa colonica nelle vicinanze. Luuk suona il violino e Finn è fortemente attratto da quella musica, nonostante il padre gli proibisca di avvicinarsi al vecchio e desideri che lui giochi a calcio. Tuttavia, Finn decide ugualmente di prendere lezioni di violino da Luuk ma, quando scoprirà le ragioni dell'avversità del padre alla musica, si ritroverà di fronte a un grande dilemma."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Nine year old Finn lives with his father in a small town. Together with his best friend Erik he plays football, but he prefers to play music. His dad wants him to play football, just like every other kid his age. Finn does not understand why, but his father doesn't want to talk about it. When Finn meets a mysterious old man, who plays the violin beautifully, he decides to learn how to play the violin as well. The old man teaches him, while Finn's dad thinks he is playing football... Is Finn the only one who sees the magic of music? What does his father hide?"},{"language":"nl-NL","overview":"De negenjarige Finn woont met zijn vader op het platteland. Samen met zijn beste vriend Erik zit hij op voetbal. Finn wil graag muziek maken, maar zijn vader wil liever dat hij gewoon gaat voetballen, net als alle andere jongens. Finn snapt niet waarom, maar zijn vader wil er niet over praten. Bij een vervallen boerderij ontmoet Finn een oude man die de sterren van de hemel speelt op een viool. Terwijl zijn vader denkt dat hij gaat voetballen, gaat Finn voortaan stiekem naar de boerderij om te oefenen. Zijn beste vriend Erik verklaart hem voor gek. Is Finn dan de enige die ziet hoe betoverend muziek kan zijn? Of is er iets anders aan de hand?"}],"